2026-09-28 10:12:20,006 INFO deepagent.transcript: [ai] tool_calls=[write_file({'file_path': '/outputs/job-d559a533-f213-4744-9e90-c578859a7a58/README.md', 'content': '# Enterprise HR Management API\n\nSpring Boot REST backend for employee onboarding, organization structure, attendance, leave approval, payroll, performance review cycles, and HR reporting.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Java 21\n- MySQL 8.4\n- Gradle wrapper (`./gradlew`)\n\n## Configuration\n\n`application.yml` reads `DB_URL`, `DB_USERNAME`, `DB_PASSWORD`, `JWT_SECRET`, `JWT_EXPIRATION_MS`, and `SERVER_PORT` from the environment. Local defaults are intended only for development.\n\nStart MySQL with `docker compose up -d mysql`, then run:\n\n```sh\n./gradlew bootRun\n```\n\nAll APIs are rooted at `/api`. `POST /api/auth/login` is public; all other routes require `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Authorities are exactly `ROLE_HR`, `ROLE_MANAGER`, and `ROLE_EMPLOYEE`.\n\n## Verification\n\n```sh\n./gradlew build\n./gradlew test\ncurl -sS -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login -H \'Content-Type: application/json\' -d \'{"email":"unknown@example.com","password":"invalid"}\'\n```\n\nThe final test and project reports are in `tests-artifacts/`.\n'})] [{'arguments': '{"file_path":"/outputs/job-d559a533-f213-4744-9e90-c578859a7a58/README.md","content":"# Enterprise HR Management API\\n\\nSpring Boot REST backend for employee onboarding, organization structure, attendance, leave approval, payroll, performance review cycles, and HR reporting.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n- Java 21\\n- MySQL 8.4\\n- Gradle wrapper (`./gradlew`)\\n\\n## Configuration\\n\\n`application.yml` reads `DB_URL`, `DB_USERNAME`, `DB_PASSWORD`, `JWT_SECRET`, `JWT_EXPIRATION_MS`, and `SERVER_PORT` from the environment. Local defaults are intended only for development.\\n\\nStart MySQL with `docker compose up -d mysql`, then run:\\n\\n```sh\\n./gradlew bootRun\\n```\\n\\nAll APIs are rooted at `/api`. `POST /api/auth/login` is public; all other routes require `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Authorities are exactly `ROLE_HR`, `ROLE_MANAGER`, and `ROLE_EMPLOYEE`.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n```sh\\n./gradlew build\\n./gradlew test\\ncurl -sS -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login -H \'Content-Type: application/json\' -d \'{\\"email\\":\\"unknown@example.com\\",\\"password\\":\\"invalid\\"}\'\\n```\\n\\nThe final test and project reports are in `tests-artifacts/`.\\n"}', 'call_id': 'call_3vvFV3a5xKztsglozYXTpQHM', 'name': 'write_file', 'type': 'function_call', 'id': 'fc_0fd1f732dc10d602006aba3d807b5887d2ab32c388dfed848b', 'status': 'completed'}]
